  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the disapproving cat scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the disapproving cat scene, as the meme format uses the cat's expression to represent the user's own stance or opinion. The cat's stern, disapproving look is culturally understood as a proxy for the viewer's rejection, implying 'I say no' to the government question posed. This is a common semiotic projection in internet memes where the visual material (the cat) serves as a stand-in for the user's own position or emotion.",
